{"1481820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DreamScript", "steam_appid": 1481820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play and program the game at the same time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > DreamScript is an experimental first-person puzzle game where you solve puzzles by reprogramming the environment. Take control of the game logic and rewrite the rules! Increase your speed and scale, modify object properties, spawn items, create bugs — use your creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure full of surprises awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2-5 hour single-player story campaign </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 18 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6 unique environments </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hidden collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Speedrun mode and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Programming guide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam Cloud save support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Target audience:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle game fans, adventure game fans, programming enthusiasts, educators, and schools</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play and program the game at the same time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > DreamScript is an experimental first-person puzzle game where you solve puzzles by reprogramming the environment. Take control of the game logic and rewrite the rules! Increase your speed and scale, modify object properties, spawn items, create bugs — use your creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure full of surprises awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2-5 hour single-player story campaign </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 18 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6 unique environments </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hidden collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Speedrun mode and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Programming guide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam Cloud save support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Target audience:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle game fans, adventure game fans, programming enthusiasts, educators, and schools</p>", "short_description": "DreamScript is an experimental first-person puzzle game. Reprogram your environment, complete tasks and explore the dreamy world of DreamScript.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481820/header.jpg?t=1757878882", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481820/85b58e3ada116075fc4ee99566907ac186058aa3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757878882", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481820/85b58e3ada116075fc4ee99566907ac186058aa3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757878882", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4510U Dual Core 2.00GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4400 / Radeon HD 5550<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=